The cursor engine under src/paint/, src/core.js and the extracted modules was
written by SadSnake1 and is redistributed here under the same MIT terms, as
published at https://github.com/SadSnake1/cursor-smith. It is mechanically
extracted from the released Obsidian bundle with mechanical substitutions only.
See CREDITS.md for the full breakdown of what is upstream and what this port
adds.
